<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cstart</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cstart</a>
</pre>
<p>Starting a clan begins with an application to the administrators (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Clan Startup</a>). Once they have approved your clan and set it up, its new 
clan Master types cstart, once, to take it up: you become the Master of the 
clan, you get its tattoo, and its clan hall becomes your hometown.
</p><p>Cstart only works for the Master the administrators named, and not if you 
already belong to a clan. Then appoint your clan lords (<a cmd='#'>Help Cappoint</a>) and 
take in your first members (<a cmd='#'>Help Caccept</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Startup</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Master</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>